WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:32.333
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna said

2
00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:34.083
that a yogi must remove their mind

3
00:00:34.083 --> 00:00:35.541
from all things

4
00:00:35.541 --> 00:00:38.333
that affect the senses,

5
00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:39.791
and focus that mind only

6
00:00:39.791 --> 00:00:42.583
on their soul.

7
00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:45.750
But Lord Krishna knows the restlessness

8
00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.625
and instability of the mind.

9
00:00:47.625 --> 00:00:48.500
And in this verse,

10
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.791
he mentions this very thing.

11
00:00:50.791 --> 00:00:52.875
He explains the remedy

12
00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:54.750
to control the mind.

13
00:00:59.541 --> 00:01:01.291
In this verse, Lord Krishna

14
00:01:01.291 --> 00:01:03.250
gives a practical remedy

15
00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:05.750
that is extremely helpful for a yogi,

16
00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:08.166
while acknowledging the natural restlessness

17
00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:11.750
and instability of the mind.

18
00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:15.000
He says the mind will wander, but whenever

19
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.166
this happens,

20
00:01:16.166 --> 00:01:18.041
it must be controlled each time

21
00:01:18.041 --> 00:01:20.666
and brought back under control.

22
00:01:20.666 --> 00:01:23.791
This remedy may seem quite simple,

23
00:01:23.791 --> 00:01:26.375
but this is a very important

24
00:01:26.375 --> 00:01:29.208
part of yoga practice.

25
00:01:29.208 --> 00:01:30.083
Lord Krishna

26
00:01:30.083 --> 00:01:31.708
describes three forms of the mind

27
00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:33.916
in this verse:

28
00:01:33.916 --> 00:01:38.250
niśchalati meaning wandering, 
chañchalam meaning restless,

29
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:42.833
and asthiram meaning unstable.

30
00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:44.708
From these words it becomes clear

31
00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:48.958
that this is the biggest 
challenge for every spiritual seeker.

32
00:01:48.958 --> 00:01:52.166
Because on one hand the
 mind must be controlled,

33
00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:53.791
but on the other hand,

34
00:01:53.791 --> 00:01:56.041
it is unstable by nature,

35
00:01:56.041 --> 00:01:58.041
easily gets disturbed,

36
00:01:58.041 --> 00:02:00.041
wanders toward objects of

37
00:02:00.041 --> 00:02:01.500
sensory pleasure.

38
00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:04.166
The mind is like a monkey

39
00:02:04.166 --> 00:02:05.791
that just keeps jumping

40
00:02:05.791 --> 00:02:08.458
from one branch to another,

41
00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:10.583
never stays in one place.

42
00:02:10.583 --> 00:02:13.791
Think – we all experience this state:

43
00:02:13.791 --> 00:02:18.458
our thoughts keep moving without 
any pause in desires, worries, old memories,

44
00:02:18.458 --> 00:02:22.041
and who knows what directions.

45
00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:24.458
The mind's wandering is its nature,

46
00:02:24.458 --> 00:02:26.750
it cannot be stopped completely,

47
00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:28.833
but there is definitely a solution.

48
00:02:28.833 --> 00:02:30.083
This solution is

49
00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:31.125
quite simple

50
00:02:31.125 --> 00:02:34.250
and is only possible through
 continuous practice.

51
00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:37.375
As soon as you see the mind is getting disturbed,

52
00:02:37.375 --> 00:02:39.208
immediately pull it back

53
00:02:39.208 --> 00:02:40.791
and focus it.

54
00:02:40.791 --> 00:02:42.041
The mind will wander again,

55
00:02:42.041 --> 00:02:43.875
it must be focused again.

56
00:02:43.875 --> 00:02:45.291
This process must be repeated

57
00:02:45.291 --> 00:02:48.875
again and again with patience and purity.

58
00:02:48.875 --> 00:02:50.750
Lord Krishna explains this:

59
00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:54.500
a yogi should not be disappointed
 by the mind's restlessness.

60
00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:55.416
Rather, they should

61
00:02:55.416 --> 00:02:57.083
keep controlling it back

62
00:02:57.083 --> 00:02:59.250
with patience.

63
00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:02.875
The main thing here is continuous practice.

64
00:03:02.875 --> 00:03:05.250
One who practices continuously, their mind

65
00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:08.666
will gradually become accustomed
 to remaining focused.

66
00:03:08.666 --> 00:03:14.125
And this concentration of mind
 is a very great spiritual achievement.

67
00:03:18.625 --> 00:03:21.208
A person often resolves to

68
00:03:21.208 --> 00:03:25.041
bring improvement in their life,

69
00:03:25.041 --> 00:03:28.083
sets new goals,

70
00:03:28.083 --> 00:03:31.083
but after some time

71
00:03:31.083 --> 00:03:36.416
returns to old habits again.

72
00:03:36.416 --> 00:03:41.958
This attempt at change seems quite unstable:

73
00:03:41.958 --> 00:03:45.833
sometimes there's progress, sometimes it stops,

74
00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:51.500
sometimes we forget the purpose and wander.

75
00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.208
This is all

76
00:03:53.208 --> 00:03:55.708
like the restlessness

77
00:03:55.708 --> 00:03:58.250
and instability of the mind.

78
00:03:58.250 --> 00:03:59.666
Suppose

79
00:03:59.666 --> 00:04:03.916
you want to give up a bad habit:

80
00:04:03.916 --> 00:04:08.375
habit of postponing important work, habit of

81
00:04:08.375 --> 00:04:13.166
eating excessively, habit of laziness, etc.

82
00:04:13.166 --> 00:04:15.750
You set a goal,

83
00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.541
work on it,

84
00:04:17.541 --> 00:04:20.958
some progress also happens.

85
00:04:20.958 --> 00:04:22.500
But one day,

86
00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:26.041
you repeat that same mistake again,

87
00:04:26.041 --> 00:04:28.250
for a few moments the old

88
00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:31.416
habit comes back.

89
00:04:31.416 --> 00:04:34.333
You curse yourself.

90
00:04:34.333 --> 00:04:37.500
The mind's confidence breaks –

91
00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:42.166
that maybe you just can't improve.

92
00:04:42.166 --> 00:04:43.416
And many times,

93
00:04:43.416 --> 00:04:47.791
getting disappointed, you 
give up that change itself.

94
00:04:47.791 --> 00:04:50.333
Here is where this verse

95
00:04:50.333 --> 00:04:55.083
gives a very important message.

96
00:04:55.083 --> 00:04:59.333
Most essential is knowing

97
00:04:59.333 --> 00:05:02.666
that all this is natural.

98
00:05:02.666 --> 00:05:05.791
The mind is unstable,

99
00:05:05.791 --> 00:05:08.041
will wander,

100
00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:12.041
will take you back to old habits.

101
00:05:12.041 --> 00:05:15.541
But you shouldn't be disappointed by this.

102
00:05:15.541 --> 00:05:17.791
Because the truth is,

103
00:05:17.791 --> 00:05:21.958
this is the process of change itself.

104
00:05:21.958 --> 00:05:24.291
Just as a yogi

105
00:05:24.291 --> 00:05:29.125
brings their mind back again 
and again from wandering,

106
00:05:29.125 --> 00:05:31.833
similarly you too must

107
00:05:31.833 --> 00:05:35.833
return firmly to your path.

108
00:05:35.833 --> 00:05:39.958
However many times you wander.

109
00:05:39.958 --> 00:05:42.416
However many times you fall

110
00:05:42.416 --> 00:05:45.125
while walking on the path of improvement,

111
00:05:45.125 --> 00:05:48.375
you must stand up again,

112
00:05:48.375 --> 00:05:50.500
even if small,

113
00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:54.083
you must take a step forward.

114
00:05:54.083 --> 00:05:56.333
Because this small step is

115
00:05:56.333 --> 00:05:59.625
the most important.

116
00:05:59.625 --> 00:06:00.625
Every such

117
00:06:00.625 --> 00:06:04.041
small step is your victory.

118
00:06:04.041 --> 00:06:08.458
True victory is in recognizing

119
00:06:08.458 --> 00:06:11.541
that you are wandering,

120
00:06:11.541 --> 00:06:14.500
and after this recognition, returning

121
00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:17.875
to your effort.

122
00:06:17.875 --> 00:06:20.916
True victory is in making continuous

123
00:06:20.916 --> 00:06:22.875
small progress.

124
00:06:22.875 --> 00:06:26.666
And by doing so, ultimately success

125
00:06:26.666 --> 00:06:30.500
will come automatically.

126
00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:33.833
Ask any successful person,

127
00:06:33.833 --> 00:06:36.375
they will tell you this:

128
00:06:36.375 --> 00:06:37.666
success

129
00:06:37.666 --> 00:06:41.333
comes only from continuous practice.

130
00:06:41.333 --> 00:06:44.250
Just as from continuous exercise,

131
00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:46.416
the body becomes strong,

132
00:06:46.416 --> 00:06:49.375
similarly, patience, practice,

133
00:06:49.375 --> 00:06:52.833
and dedication increase willpower,

134
00:06:52.833 --> 00:06:57.083
which takes you to the peak of advancement.

135
00:07:01.708 --> 00:07:04.916
The mind is naturally restless,

136
00:07:04.916 --> 00:07:06.833
sometimes runs here,

137
00:07:06.833 --> 00:07:09.291
sometimes there.

138
00:07:09.291 --> 00:07:11.583
In the family, children

139
00:07:11.583 --> 00:07:15.250
or small kids are also like this –

140
00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:17.458
restless, unstable,

141
00:07:17.458 --> 00:07:22.166
whose concentration doesn't stay in one place.

142
00:07:22.166 --> 00:07:23.791
When the mind wanders,

143
00:07:23.791 --> 00:07:27.750
a yogi doesn't get disappointed, nor angry.

144
00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:30.125
They just

145
00:07:30.125 --> 00:07:32.416
focus the mind again.

146
00:07:32.416 --> 00:07:33.625
Similarly,

147
00:07:33.625 --> 00:07:37.625
you too must lead the little ones in your family

148
00:07:37.625 --> 00:07:41.666
to the right path with patience and love.

149
00:07:41.666 --> 00:07:44.416
They will wander, make mistakes,

150
00:07:44.416 --> 00:07:47.583
change their direction from time to time.

151
00:07:47.583 --> 00:07:50.791
Many times children won't listen to you.

152
00:07:50.791 --> 00:07:53.958
You'll feel that even after
 explaining so many times,

153
00:07:53.958 --> 00:07:57.625
no change is happening.

154
00:07:57.625 --> 00:07:59.541
But this doesn't mean

155
00:07:59.541 --> 00:08:02.041
they can't improve.

156
00:08:02.041 --> 00:08:03.791
Don't be disappointed,

157
00:08:03.791 --> 00:08:06.291
like a yogi,

158
00:08:06.291 --> 00:08:08.208
you too must

159
00:08:08.208 --> 00:08:09.875
have patience.

160
00:08:09.875 --> 00:08:11.000
Expecting immediate

161
00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:14.083
improvement in children is like expecting

162
00:08:14.083 --> 00:08:17.625
to pull a seed and make it a plant

163
00:08:17.625 --> 00:08:22.583
and then a tree in just one day.

164
00:08:22.583 --> 00:08:23.833
Your purpose

165
00:08:23.833 --> 00:08:26.833
is not to bring immediate change,

166
00:08:26.833 --> 00:08:31.375
but to inspire them again and again

167
00:08:31.375 --> 00:08:32.208
to return to the right

168
00:08:32.208 --> 00:08:35.375
direction with love and understanding.

169
00:08:35.375 --> 00:08:39.833
Remember, this is about inspiring,

170
00:08:39.833 --> 00:08:42.333
not ordering.

171
00:08:42.333 --> 00:08:44.041
For this,

172
00:08:44.041 --> 00:08:47.333
you must listen to and understand

173
00:08:47.333 --> 00:08:49.750
children's perspectives.

174
00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:53.958
You must explain your point
 from their perspective.

175
00:08:53.958 --> 00:08:56.750
Also you must

176
00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:59.875
live by the values you teach,

177
00:08:59.875 --> 00:09:03.416
set an example.

178
00:09:03.416 --> 00:09:07.125
Good habits must be discussed continuously.

179
00:09:07.125 --> 00:09:11.125
Just keep walking on this path,

180
00:09:11.125 --> 00:09:14.291
you will definitely see improvement.

181
00:09:18.666 --> 00:09:20.916
Continuous effort

182
00:09:20.916 --> 00:09:24.083
and the determination to keep moving forward

183
00:09:24.083 --> 00:09:26.291
even after failure –

184
00:09:26.291 --> 00:09:29.375
this very quality and ability

185
00:09:29.375 --> 00:09:33.208
makes successful people different.

186
00:09:33.208 --> 00:09:35.750
Difficulties will come,

187
00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:38.583
but only one who rises above them

188
00:09:38.583 --> 00:09:40.375
instead of getting discouraged by them

189
00:09:40.375 --> 00:09:43.666
will succeed in the professional world.

190
00:09:43.666 --> 00:09:45.750
Imagine

191
00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:47.541
you've been assigned

192
00:09:47.541 --> 00:09:51.250
an important project in the organization.

193
00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:54.583
You worked with complete dedication,

194
00:09:54.583 --> 00:09:58.041
but the results that should have come

195
00:09:58.041 --> 00:10:00.291
didn't come.

196
00:10:00.291 --> 00:10:03.625
Maybe the plan couldn't 
be implemented properly,

197
00:10:03.625 --> 00:10:05.541
or some lack remained

198
00:10:05.541 --> 00:10:09.000
in coordination among colleagues.

199
00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:13.000
At such times a person gets disappointed,

200
00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:16.458
doubts themselves, or sometimes

201
00:10:16.458 --> 00:10:19.375
gives up trying by accepting defeat.

202
00:10:19.375 --> 00:10:22.500
But like a yogi,

203
00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:24.000
you too must

204
00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:27.416
save your mind from getting disturbed.

205
00:10:27.416 --> 00:10:29.291
Just as a yogi focuses their

206
00:10:29.291 --> 00:10:30.166
wandering mind

207
00:10:30.166 --> 00:10:34.125
again and again, similarly you too must

208
00:10:34.125 --> 00:10:35.708
during times of difficulty

209
00:10:35.708 --> 00:10:38.250
keep your vision focused

210
00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:40.375
on the goal.

211
00:10:40.375 --> 00:10:41.125
The person who

212
00:10:41.125 --> 00:10:41.666
learns

213
00:10:41.666 --> 00:10:42.958
from failure and moves forward

214
00:10:42.958 --> 00:10:45.958
with patience and determination

215
00:10:45.958 --> 00:10:49.375
is a successful person in the true sense.

216
00:10:49.375 --> 00:10:50.458
When next time

217
00:10:50.458 --> 00:10:54.416
you face some problem or defeat,

218
00:10:54.416 --> 00:10:57.708
don't see it as a signal to stop,

219
00:10:57.708 --> 00:11:02.875
but see it like an important lesson.

220
00:11:02.875 --> 00:11:05.250
And from every new lesson

221
00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:07.916
you're gaining experience,

222
00:11:07.916 --> 00:11:10.458
you're becoming stronger,

223
00:11:10.458 --> 00:11:13.708
and moving toward success.

224
00:11:13.708 --> 00:11:16.500
Failure cannot stop you –

225
00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:18.958
failure is an opportunity

226
00:11:18.958 --> 00:11:23.000
for you to make your plan

227
00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.291
even better from a new perspective.
